    模 | mó | model; pattern | Has wood radical 木 on the left instead of 扌
    漠 | mò | desert; aloof | Has water radical 氵 on the left instead of 扌
    膜 | mó | membrane; thin film | Has flesh radical 月 on the left instead of 扌
    寞 | mò | lonely; quiet | Has roof radical 宀 at the top
    摹 | mó | trace; copy handwriting | Has hand 手 at the bottom instead of 扌 on the left
